00:56:11.740 --> 00:56:16.130
<v Jonathan's Friend>Drop them a little present, you know? Some snow, a little extra for them.
<v Jonathan's Friend>留点小礼物，你知道吗？多给他们一点雪，一点额外的“回馈”。

00:56:16.130 --> 00:57:29.950
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多关于美国生活的故事。

